<title>USA: Cash America says 6.36 mln shares tendered.</title>
<headline>Cash America says 6.36 mln shares tendered.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash America International Inc said preliminary results of its &quot;Dutch Auction&quot; self-tender offer indicate that 6,362,041 shares of common stock were tendered and not withdrawn at prices of $8.50 per share or lower.</p>
<p>The offering expired at midnight, December 17.</p>
<p>The company said the 6.36 million shares does not include 550,301 shares tendered by notice of guaranteed delivery.</p>
<p>Cash America said previously that it expects to buy 4.5 million shares at $8.50, representing about 65.1 percent of the total number of shares tendered.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
